  "solution": "Follow BODMAS rule to solve this question, as per the order given below,\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/8081cb6e2e9e278f0c5fc562dac27ef17f224dea87eefe9e8c2ff8e4b8ac4dbd.png] \n\n**Given:**\n\n(6.25+frac{5)/(7)×28-5}{(3)/(4)×(15.8-3.4)+5×2.39}\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n(6.25+frac{5)/(7)×28-5}{(3)/(4)×(15.8-3.4)+5×2.39}\n\n⇒ (6.25 + 5 × 4 - 5)/(3/4 × (12.4) + 11.95)\n\n⇒ (6.25 + 20 - 5)/(3 × 3.1 + 11.95) \n\n⇒ (6.25 + 20 - 5)/(3 × 3.1 + 11.95) \n\n⇒ 21.25/21.25\n\n⇒ 1\n\n**∴ The required result = 1** \n\n1bd:T5",
